Package: harmoods
Title: Harmonised Depression Score Converter
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R:
    person("Emma", "Corley", email = "emma.corley@universityofgalway.ie",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0000-0000-0000"))
Description: A Shiny application that harmonises item-level responses from the
    Hamilton Depression Rating Scale (HDRS), Beck Depression Inventory (BDI),
    and Montgomery-Åsberg Depression Rating Scale (MADRS) onto a common latent
    severity metric using item response theory (IRT) graded response models.
    Calibration was performed in a multisite ENIGMA Mood Disorders cohort
    (n=11,171; 47 international sites) and provides scores for five symptom
    domains plus an overall depression severity general factor.
